This project includes and depends on the following third-party components. It
is your responsibility as a user or contributor to comply with their licenses.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ploaj/HSDLib  (HSDRaw + HSDRawViewer)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source: https://github.com/Ploaj/HSDLib
License: MIT

Files in `hsdcli/hsdlib_import/` are adapted from HSDRawViewer.IO and
HSDRawViewer.Extensions. Windows-forms references were stripped so the code
builds on headless Linux. Original copyright:

    HSDRaw, HSDRawViewer
    Copyright (c) Ploaj  https://github.com/Ploaj

Full HSDLib LICENSE at:
    https://github.com/Ploaj/HSDLib/blob/master/LICENSE

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IONET  (bundled binary at runtime, referenced but not shipped)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source: https://github.com/Ploaj/IONET
License: MIT
The `hsdcli/HSDCli.csproj` references `IONET.dll` from a local build of the
Ploaj/HSDLib repository. Users must clone and build HSDLib themselves to
produce the DLL — see README `Building` section.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Blender
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
https://www.blender.org — GPL. Used as an external tool via subprocess; no
Blender source is included in this repository.

