Google Gemini  https://ai.google.dev  (nano-banana image model)

===============================================================================
COPYRIGHT POLICY FOR USER CONTENT
===============================================================================

Users MUST upload their own base .DAT (extracted from their own legally-owned
copy of Super Smash Bros. Melee) and their own game ISO. No Nintendo/HAL
copyrighted assets are shipped with this software. Uploads are stored under
SHA-256-hashed identifiers and are never publicly listed.

Super Smash Bros. Melee is © 2001 HAL Laboratory / Nintendo. This project has
no affiliation with, or endorsement from, HAL, Nintendo, or Ploaj.
